<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
  <title>{{ email_title }}</title>
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/assets/notifications/styles.css">
  <style>
    .button__cell { background: {{ shop.email_accent_color }}; }
    .actions-buttons .button__cell--primary { background-color: {{ shop.email_accent_color }}; }
    a, a:hover, a:active, a:visited { color: {{ shop.email_accent_color }}; }
    .creditcard { background:#f7f6f4; border-radius:14px; }
    .creditcard__label { font-size:14px; color:#6b6b6b; padding-top:22px; }
    .creditcard__amount { font-size:40px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.1; padding:6px 0 2px; }
    .creditcard__expiry { font-size:14px; padding-bottom:22px; }
    .value-line { font-size:15px; color:#3d3d3d; }
    .present-line { font-size:20px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.3px; }
    .whatsnew__title { font-size:16px; font-weight:700; padding:8px 0 18px; }
    .mist-img { width:170px; max-width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:10px; }
    .mist__name { font-size:15px; font-weight:700; padding-top:10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.4px; color:#DF3630; }
    .mist__sub { font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#000000; padding-top:2px; }
    .mist__desc { font-size:12px; color:#6b6b6b; padding:4px 8px 0; line-height:1.4; }
    .preheader { display:none !important; visibility:hidden; opacity:0; color:transparent; height:0; width:0; }
    @media only screen and (max-width:480px) {
      .mist-cell { display:block !important; width:100% !important; padding-bottom:24px !important; }
      .mist-img { width:230px !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

  <body>
    <span class="preheader">Sua última compra gerou crédito na sua conta GE Beauty. Aproveite antes que expire.</span>
    <table align="center" class="body">
      <tr><td class="empty-line">&nbsp;</td></tr>
      <tr>
        <td>
          <table class="row content">
  <tr>
    <td class="content__cell">
      <center>
        <table class="container">
          <tr>
            <td>

            {% if shop.email_logo_url %}
              <table align="center" class="store_credit__topmargin">
                <tr><td><img src="{{shop.email_logo_url}}" alt="{{ shop.name }}" class="store_credit__logosize" width="{{ shop.email_logo_width }}"></td></tr>
              </table>
            {% endif %}

            {%- comment -%} Lifecycle opener by order count (New / Returning / Loyal). {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- assign oc = customer.orders_count | default: 1 -%}

            <table align="center" class="row store_credit__topmargin">
              <tr>
                <td class="store_credit__message store_credit__top_padding">
                  {% if customer.first_name %}Oii, {{ customer.first_name }}!{% else %}Oii!{% endif %}
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="store_credit__message store_credit__top_padding">
                  {% if oc >= 5 %}
                    Já faz um tempão que você caminha com a GE Beauty, e a gente é grata por cada passo dessa jornada 💛
                  {% elsif oc >= 2 %}
                    Que bom te ver voltando pra cuidar do seu cabelo 💛 A sua rotina já está tomando forma.
                  {% else %}
                    Que bom ter você na GE Beauty 💛 A sua rotina de cuidados está só começando, e a gente quer caminhar junto.
                  {% endif %}
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="store_credit__message store_credit__top_padding">
                  É bom se cuidar, né? Pra você não parar, temos
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="store_credit__message present-line store_credit__top_padding">
                  uma informação importante:
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            {%- comment -%} Credit card: still-active framing (no "reativado"), plain validity. {%- endcomment -%}
            <table align="center" class="row creditcard" width="100%">
              <tr><td align="center" class="creditcard__label">Sua última compra gerou</td></tr>
              <tr><td align="center" class="creditcard__amount">{{ issued_store_credit.amount | money }}</td></tr>
              {% if issued_store_credit.expires_at %}
                <tr><td align="center" class="creditcard__expiry">de créditos, válidos até <strong>{{ issued_store_credit.expires_at | date: format: 'date' }}</strong></td></tr>
              {% endif %}
            </table>

            <table align="center" class="row store_credit__topmargin">
              <tr>
                <td class="store_credit__message value-line store_credit__top_padding">
                  O valor já está na sua conta! Use para <strong>continuar a construir sua rotina de cuidados</strong>, ou para <em style="text-decoration:underline;">conhecer seus novos favoritos</em>!
                </td>
              </tr>
              {% if company_location %}
                <tr>
                  <td class="store_credit__message store_credit__top_padding">
                    O valor foi adicionado à conta de {{ company_location.name }} em {{ company_location.company.name }}. O saldo agora é de {{ issued_store_credit.balance_after_transaction | money }}.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              {% endif %}
            </table>

            {%- comment -%} What's new: HARDCODED (notification templates can't query products/metafields). {%- endcomment -%}
            <table align="center" class="row store_credit__topmargin" width="100%">
              <tr><td align="center" class="whatsnew__title">Confira algumas sugestões que preparamos:</td></tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  {%- assign recs = customer.metafields.custom.recommended_products.value -%}
                  <table align="center" width="100%">
                    <tr>
                    {%- if recs and recs.size > 0 -%}
                      {%- for p in recs limit: 3 -%}
                      <td class="mist-cell" align="center" width="33%" valign="top">
                        <a href="{{ shop.url }}{{ p.url }}?utm_source=email&utm_medium=notification&utm_campaign=store-credit-stillactive&utm_content=rec_{{ p.handle }}" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit; display:block;">
                          <img class="mist-img" src="{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 340 }}" alt="{{ p.title }}" width="170">
                          <div class="mist__name">{{ p.title | upcase }}</div>
                          {%- if p.metafields.custom.finalidade -%}<div class="mist__desc">{{ p.metafields.custom.finalidade.value }}</div>{%- endif -%}
                        </a>
                      </td>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    {%- else -%}
                      <td class="mist-cell" align="center" width="33%" valign="top">
                        <a href="https://www.gebeauty.com.br/products/rose-ritual-body-hair-mist?utm_source=email&utm_medium=notification&utm_campaign=store-credit-stillactive&utm_content=mist_rose" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit; display:block;">
                          <img class="mist-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0807/8344/2240/files/sq_rose-ritual_1812.png?v=1782260717" alt="Rose Ritual Body & Hair Mist" width="170">
                          <div class="mist__name">Rose Ritual</div>
                          <div class="mist__sub">Body &amp; Hair Mist</div>
                          <div class="mist__desc">delicadeza floral de rosas, lichia e frutas vermelhas</div>
                        </a>
                      </td>
                      <td class="mist-cell" align="center" width="33%" valign="top">
                        <a href="https://www.gebeauty.com.br/products/pear-fresh-body-hair-mist?utm_source=email&utm_medium=notification&utm_campaign=store-credit-stillactive&utm_content=mist_pear" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit; display:block;">
                          <img class="mist-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0807/8344/2240/files/sq_pear-fresh_1781.png?v=1782260727" alt="Pear Fresh Body & Hair Mist" width="170">
                          <div class="mist__name">Pear Fresh</div>
                          <div class="mist__sub">Body &amp; Hair Mist</div>
                          <div class="mist__desc">frescor vibrante de pêra, lírio e musk</div>
                        </a>
                      </td>
                      <td class="mist-cell" align="center" width="33%" valign="top">
                        <a href="https://www.gebeauty.com.br/products/santal-skin-body-hair-mist?utm_source=email&utm_medium=notification&utm_campaign=store-credit-stillactive&utm_content=mist_santal" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit; display:block;">
                          <img class="mist-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0807/8344/2240/files/sq_santal-skin_1912.png?v=1782260936" alt="Santal Skin Body & Hair Mist" width="170">
                          <div class="mist__name">Santal Skin</div>
                          <div class="mist__sub">Body &amp; Hair Mist</div>
                          <div class="mist__desc">elegância de sândalo, cardamomo e patchouli</div>
                        </a>
                      </td>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <table align="center" class="row store_credit__topmargin">
              <tr>
                <td class="store_credit__message store_credit__top_padding">
                  Seu crédito já está disponível. Aproveite antes que expire 💛
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <table class="button store_credit__visit_online_store" align="center">
              <tr>
                <td class="button__cell"><a href="{{ shop.url }}?utm_source=email&utm_medium=notification&utm_campaign=store-credit-stillactive&utm_content=cta_button" class="button__text">usar meu crédito</a></td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <table align="center">
              <tr>
                <td align="center" class="link__cell">
                  <a href="{{ routes.account_profile_url }}" class="link__text">Ver meu saldo na conta</a>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <table align="center" class="row store_credit__topmargin">
              <tr><td class="store_credit__message store_credit__top_padding">Com carinho,</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="store_credit__message">Time GE Beauty ❤️</td></tr>
            </table>

            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </center>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
          <table class="row footer">
  <tr>
    <td class="footer__cell">
      <center>
        <table class="container">
          <tr><td><p class="disclaimer__subtext">Qualquer dúvida, é só responder a este email ou falar com a gente pelo <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}">{{ shop.email }}</a>.</p></td></tr>
        </table>
      </center>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<img src="{{ 'notifications/spacer.png' | shopify_asset_url }}" class="spacer" height="1" />

        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
